---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy — teesh-art">
  <div class="policy">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <p>teesh-art is operated as a sole proprietorship based in Washington State. This policy describes what information we collect, how we use it, and your rights.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you make a purchase, we collect:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Email address</strong> — for order confirmation and support</li>
      <li><strong>Shipping address</strong> — to deliver your order</li>
      <li><strong>Order details</strong> — items purchased, quantities, amounts</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do <strong>not</strong> collect or store credit card numbers. All payment processing is handled by Stripe, our third-party payment processor.</p>

    <h2>How we use your information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Fulfill and ship your order</li>
      <li>Send order confirmation and shipping updates</li>
      <li>Respond to support requests</li>
      <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
    <p>We use the following services that may process your data:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Stripe</strong> — payment processing (<a href="https://stripe.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Stripe Privacy Policy</a>)</li>
      <li><strong>Print-on-demand fulfillment partner</strong> — receives your shipping address to deliver your order</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>We retain order records for as long as needed to provide support and meet legal requirements (typically 3 years for tax purposes). You may request deletion of your data by contacting us.</p>

    <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
    <p>This site does not use cookies for advertising or analytics. We use browser localStorage solely to maintain your shopping cart between page visits. No third-party trackers are present on this site.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You may:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Request a copy of the personal data we hold about you</li>
      <li>Request correction or deletion of your data</li>
      <li>Withdraw consent at any time</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy-related questions or requests, email <strong>support@teesh-art.com</strong>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .policy {
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .policy h1 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .updated {
    color: #888;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .policy h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .policy p {
    color: #333;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .policy ul {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem 1.25rem;
    color: #333;
  }

  .policy li {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .policy a {
    color: #2563eb;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
